# MUCHI — Workers Static Assets header rules (copied into public/ at package
# build time). Mirrors the Node server's serveStatic() Cache-Control behavior:
#   .html/.js/.css -> no-store (the service worker always gets fresh copies)
#   everything else -> public, max-age=86400
# Workers-only config; the app code is untouched.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-store, max-age=0

/logo.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/logo.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/cover-default.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
